
WHOAMI(1)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            WHOAMI(1)

NAME
     whoami - print effective current user id

SYNOPSIS
     whoami

DESCRIPTION
     _W_h_o_a_m_i prints who you are.  It works even if you are su'd,
     while `who am i' does not since it uses /etc/utmp.

FILES
     /etc/passwd

SEE ALSO
     who (1)

AUTHOR
     Bill Joy

